#: manifest.ini:description
msgid ""
"Use Google's WASM text-to-speech voices locally through a supported Chromium "
"browser runtime such as Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, or Brave as an NVDA "
"synthesizer. Google TTS For NVDA is an independent, open-source "
"accessibility project. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed "
"by Google LLC. Google is a trademark of Google LLC."
msgstr ""
"通过受支持的 Chromium 浏览器运行时（如 Google Chrome、Microsoft Edge 或 "
"Brave），在本地使用 Google WASM 文字转语音技术提供的语音，并将其用作 NVDA 语"
"音合成器。NVDA 谷歌TTS插件是一个独立的开源无障碍项目。本项目不隶属于 Google "
"LLC，也未获得 Google LLC 的赞助或认可。Google 是 Google LLC 的商标。"

#: globalPlugins/googleTtsForNvda/settings.py:348
msgid "Use this language profile"
msgstr "使用此语言配置文件"

#: manifest.ini:changelog
msgid ""
"Version 1.1:\n"
"- Synchronized speech progress with audio playback for more accurate Say All "
"tracking and interruption, and made multi-sentence reading and pause "
"shortening smoother and cleaner.\n"
"- Improved high-speed speech and pitch quality on SeaNet and Lemonbalm "
"voices, enabled 8 additional Lemonbalm voice packages (168 usable packages "
"in total), and unified localized language names and sorting across NVDA.\n"
"- Updated multilingual text handling to Unicode 18.0 and CLDR 49 for more "
"accurate punctuation, emoji, writing-system, and automatic language profile "
"support.\n"
"- Strengthened security by blocking external web origins from local browser "
"communication and enforcing stricter HTTPS and download checks for voice "
"packages and add-on updates.\n"
"- Improved audio and browser runtime stability (including bypassing system "
"proxies for local speech), updated compatibility for NVDA 2027.1, and added "
"an optional Donate... button in add-on settings.\n"
"- Upgraded the bundled WASM TTS engine to version 20261110.1 and websocket-"
"client to 1.10.0, and updated translations."
msgstr ""
"版本 1.1：\n"
"- 将朗读进度与音频播放同步，使 NVDA 在全文朗读和中断长文本时更准确地跟踪朗读"
"位置，同时让多句连续朗读和停顿缩短更加顺畅自然。\n"
"- 改进 SeaNet 和 Lemonbalm 语音的高速朗读与变调音质，新增支持 8 个 Lemonbalm "
"语音包（可用语音包增至 168 个），并在 NVDA 各处统一本地化语言名称与排序方式。\n"
"- 将多语言文本处理数据更新至 Unicode 18.0 和 CLDR 49，更准确地处理标点、表情"
"符号和书写系统，并改进自动语言配置文件检测。\n"
"- 加强安全性：拒绝来自外部网页源的本地浏览器通信连接，并对语音包和插件更新下"
"载实施更严格的 HTTPS 与安全校验。\n"
"- 提升音频播放与浏览器运行时的稳定性（包括为本地朗读绕过系统代理），更新对 "
"NVDA 2027.1 的兼容支持，并在插件设置中新增可选的“捐赠...”按钮。\n"
"- 将随附的 WASM TTS 引擎升级至 20261110.1 版、websocket-client 升级至 "
"1.10.0 版，并更新翻译。"

